{"t":"A Piece of Cake I (Book)","s":"a-piece-of-cake-i-book-70059","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Untitled</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Book (Black)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Book_Black_3404b6.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Near every <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Extraction%20Machine\">Cake Extraction Machine</a>, which can be found in the cities of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Liberty%20Bay\">Liberty Bay</a>.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The first stage of the <a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a> is explained.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/a-piece-of-cake\">A Piece of Cake</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Golem\">Cake Golem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Extraction%20Machine\">Cake Extraction Machine</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Related books</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"nextbook\">Next Book</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"nextbook\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Piece%20of%20Cake%20II%20%28Book%29\">A Piece of Cake II</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Thais Libraries, Carlin Libraries, Edron Libraries, Darashia Libraries, Liberty Bay Libraries.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.70<br/>December 8, 2010<br/>Winter Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This book has no notes.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/><span></span>\n</p><ul><li>This quest has two stages.</li>\n<li>In the first stage, cake golems will attack certain cities.</li>\n<li>Once they are slain, they can be looted for a vital ingredient which should be given to one of the bakers at the cake extractor machines.</li>\n<li>It is IMPORTANT though that a certain amount of cake golems will be disassembled in the cake extraction machines. To do so, they have to be lured into the cake extractors where they will vanish. Since it is much easier to kill them, it is advised to begin with the luring part.</li>\n<li>If the first stage has been completed successfully, a bridge is built south of Cormaya after a certain amount of time.</li>\n<li>The second stage will take place on an isle south of Cormaya and explained in a book found there.</li></ul></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["a-piece-of-cake"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"a-piece-of-cake","quest":"A Piece of Cake","step":"0-0","n":1,"title":"Encontrar uma máquina de extração","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}